# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: Lumen, from its release zip Lumen.zip.
Package: Lumen
Section: Graphics
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Suggests: LumenRaw
Components: Apps.Graphics.!Lumen (Movable LookAt)
Description: Photo library and non-destructive editor
 Lumen imports, browses, rates, flags and adjusts photos without
 changing them: white balance, exposure, highlights and shadows,
 levels, curves, contrast, saturation, sharpening, crop, straighten and
 perspective, with presets, undo, a loupe and a 100% view; then exports
 them as JPEG or PNG. One window with a browser, viewer, split view
 and full screen.
 .
 Camera raw files need the LibRaw plug-in, a separate package
 (LumenRaw).
Build-Map: !Lumen -> Apps/Graphics/!Lumen
Build-Notice: Lumen, packaged for PackMan from its release zip.
